            {
              "id": "d3d5e41f-b953-4919-947c-52ab2f7e33b1",
              "type": "paragraph",
              "html": "<em><strong>Doing Things with Games: Social Impact Through Play</strong></em> was written by Lindsay Grace, published by CRC Press, July 16, 2019."
            },
            {
              "id": "a4df14e3-8ed7-4da5-a235-0036184f3011",
              "type": "paragraph",
              "html": ""
            },
            {
              "id": "28958d3b-0714-49a4-83a2-65127b100e65",
              "type": "quote",
              "html": "<em>The book provides a contemporary foundation in designing social impact games. It is structured in 3 parts: understanding, application, and implementation. The book serves as a guide to designing social impact games, particularly focused on the needs of, media professionals, indie game designers and college students. It serves as a guide for people looking to create social impact play, informed by heuristics in game design.</em>"
            },
            {
              "id": "f10ccb21-f2c2-4548-a6d9-8900e267a039",
              "type": "paragraph",
              "html": ""
